# because they share ONE reason, stated once here rather than 120 times: they
# are the SEEDED baseline, not a judgment call made row by row. A reason
# stamped on a FUTURE addition should say what it says for every other ratchet
# in this repo — why the seam is legitimately still untested and what would
# close it.
#
